{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22033","headline":"有木诗八首 四 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木名杜棃，阴森覆丘壑。\n心蠹已空朽，根深尚盘薄。\n狐媚言语巧，鸟妖声音恶。\n凭此爲巢穴，往来互栖托。\n四傍五六本，叶枝相交错。\n借问因何生，秋风吹子落。\n爲长社坛下，无人敢芟斫。\n几度野火来，风回烧不着。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}